{
  "description": "Signed service documents (protocol 9.1). sign: sign document with signer's key and compare the signed document; the signature is a JWS with typ agent-talk-service over the document in JCS with signatures left out, protected is the base64url protected header, and the payload is not carried. verify: whether the document names issuer and any of its first eight signatures checks out against a key the receiver holds for issuer. read: the document as a reader takes it (signatures and fields this version does not define left out, unknown carrier types kept), or null.",
